[node name="Formation" type="Node2D" parent="."]
editor_description = "Fixed five-actor growth bound. Runtime hides the rear pair on web builds. Every rat is kept at least 56 pixels clear of the follow target's column: the colony draws in front of the miner, so a rat parked on his origin covers the character the player is actually controlling. Keep that clearance when moving anyone here."

